    "body": "> I followed the instructions to log Bluetooth traffic at https://www.chromium.org/developers/how-tos/file-web-bluetooth-bugs to confirm the bug in the first place. Then I implemented the missing command on the Bluetooth device to fix the failure on Windows.\r\n\r\nis the missing command is BLE2902()?",
